{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q1851782","formula":"O₂Pt","hill":"O2Pt","elements":["O","Pt"],"composition":{"O":2.0,"Pt":1.0},"names":{"en":"Adams' catalyst","ru":"Катализатор Адамса"},"descriptions":{"en":"Adams' catalyst, also known as platinum dioxide, is usually represented as platinum(IV) oxide hydrate, PtO2·xH2O. It is a catalyst for hydrogenation and hydrogenolysis in organic synthesis. This dark brown powder is commercially available. The oxide itself is not an active catalyst, but it becomes active after exposure to hydrogen whereupon it converts to platinum black, which is responsible for reactions.","ru":"Катализатор Адамса (диоксид платины) — катализатор для восстановления и гидрогенолиза в органическом синтезе. Известен как гидрат диоксида платины, представляет собой тёмно-коричневый порошок. Сам по себе диоксид не является катализатором, но он переходит в активную форму после взаимодействия с водородом."},"fame":20,"pubchemCid":345198,"mass":227.08,"charge":0,"smiles":"O=[Pt]=O","inchikey":"YKIOKAURTKXMSB-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"dioxoplatinum","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"crystal","source":"materialsproject","ref":"mp-617","atoms":26,"license":"CC BY 4.0, Materials Project"},"structure":{"cell":[[3.135,0.0,0.0],[-1.567,2.715,0.0],[0.0,0.0,4.167]],"kind":"crystal","atoms":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Pt"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":4.167,"el":"Pt"},{"x":-3.135,"y":5.429,"z":0.0,"el":"Pt"},{"x":-3.135,"y":5.429,"z":4.167,"el":"Pt"},{"x":6.269,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"Pt"},{"x":6.269,"y":0.0,"z":4.167,"el":"Pt"},{"x":3.135,"y":5.429,"z":0.0,"el":"Pt"},{"x":3.135,"y":5.429,"z":4.167,"el":"Pt"},{"x":1.567,"y":0.905,"z":3.234,"el":"O"},{"x":0.0,"y":1.81,"z":0.934,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.567,"y":2.715,"z":0.0,"el":"Pt"},{"x":-1.567,"y":2.715,"z":4.167,"el":"Pt"},{"x":4.702,"y":2.715,"z":0.0,"el":"Pt"},{"x":4.702,"y":2.715,"z":4.167,"el":"Pt